WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:06.310
Here's a week of review requests at a made-up salon. Every message is the real output of the code.

2
00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:12.940
Two hours after Ana's visit, a short thank-you goes out, with the salon's Google review link.

3
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.830
Jordan's visit ended in the evening, so the message waited for the morning.

4
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.750
Tom didn't show up, so Tom isn't asked.

5
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.720
Ana came back, but was already asked this year.

6
00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:30.870
Priya's email can't be used, so it's skipped, not guessed.

7
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.270
And Sam gets a thank-you that afternoon.

8
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:41.860
Review requests are two hundred and fifty dollars. Everyone gets the same link, as Google's rules require.
